home, oh my bills are due

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:42.130
I don't know what to do.

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:44.530
I do know what to do.

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:46.063
I do know what I can do.

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:49.280
It's not something that I wanna do,

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:51.130
but man it's all that I know,

00:14:51.130 --> 00:14:52.623
right now I need the money.

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:57.360
It's very hard for a
person to fall back into.

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:58.520
- [Mark] I'm proud of you.

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:00.080
- Thank you, I appreciate it.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.780
- [Mark] Okay, thank you so
much for coming in again.

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:02.613
- No problem.

00:15:02.613 --> 00:15:04.560
Thank you for listening to my story.

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:05.393
